Because you asked the question hundreds of times, I will provide a comprehensive and detailed explanation of the **Theory of Relativity**. The theory of relativity is not a single theory but rather two interconnected theories developed by Albert Einstein: **Special Relativity** and **General Relativity**.
Here is a detailed breakdown of both components.
